<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Blind Curve"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Rainych"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1540623213"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">说着明晚还想再见这种话</text><text for="L2">你真是个净提任性要求的人呢</text><text for="L3">周五夜晚 停下白色BMW</text><text for="L4">高速路上 凝视着彼此的两人</text><text for="L5">若是摇下右侧的车窗</text><text for="L6">海浪声便近在耳畔</text><text for="L7">你指尖夹着的香烟</text><text for="L8">烟灰悄然飘落 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(灰烬飘落)</span></text><text for="L9">随后说着「让我来教你」</text><text for="L10">又突然脱口而出「我需要你」</text><text for="L11">这就是你惯用的套路吧</text><text for="L12">可是 请别随意评判我</text><text for="L13">并不讨厌你 但请别碰我</text><text for="L14">在感情里我并不擅长周旋 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(笨拙的我)</span></text><text for="L15">是啊 谈情说爱总让我有些不知所措 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(正是如此)</span></text><text for="L16">说着「把我的住址留给你吧」</text><text for="L17">便在小巧的便签本上匆匆写下</text><text for="L18">午夜时分 飞掠过长桥时</text><text for="L19">月色下 倒映出泛着锈色的冷月</text><text for="L20">拐过下一处弯道</text><text for="L21">远方的街市灯火渐近</text><text for="L22">我取出随身的唇膏</text><text for="L23">细细抹上红唇 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(那一抹嫣红)</span></text><text for="L24">随后轻语「让我吻你」</text><text for="L25">若是动了真心「我就带你走」</text><text for="L26">我就会渐渐看不清你了 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(捉摸不透的你)</span></text><text for="L27">但是 请别责怪我</text><text for="L28">今晚就到此为止吧 别再想念我</text><text for="L29">我终究没有这份自信 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(胆怯的我)</span></text><text for="L30">没错 爱情总让我有些退缩 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(真的呢)</span></text><text for="L31">随后换我说「让我来教你」</text><text for="L32">去对别的女孩倾诉「我需要你」</text><text for="L33">去好好疼爱她吧 亲爱的</text><text for="L34">可也请别评判我</text><text for="L35">是你打错算盘了 请别碰我</text><text for="L36">笨拙的我可无法顺你的意</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:03.540"><div begin="0:21.260" end="4:03.540"><p begin="0:21.260" end="0:28.520" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.260" end="0:21.570">ま</span><span begin="0:21.570" end="0:21.980">た</span><span begin="0:21.980" end="0:23.460">明日</span><span begin="0:23.460" end="0:23.950">の</span><span begin="0:23.950" end="0:24.870">夜</span><span begin="0:25.600" end="0:25.840">逢</span><span begin="0:25.840" end="0:25.960">い</span><span begin="0:25.960" end="0:26.610">た</span><span begin="0:26.610" end="0:26.850">い</span><span begin="0:27.060" end="0:27.840">なん</span><span begin="0:27.840" end="0:28.520">て</span></p><p begin="0:29.590" end="0:36.810" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.590" end="0:29.960">無</span><span begin="0:29.960" end="0:30.110">理</span><span begin="0:30.110" end="0:30.600">な</span><span begin="0:30.600" end="0:31.720">事</span><span begin="0:31.720" end="0:32.190">ば</span><span begin="0:32.190" end="0:32.850">か</span><span begin="0:32.850" end="0:33.220">り</span><span begin="0:33.780" end="0:34.220">言っ</span><span begin="0:34.220" end="0:34.900">て</span><span begin="0:34.900" end="0:35.200">る</span><span begin="0:35.230" end="0:36.140">人</span><span begin="0:36.140" end="0:36.810">ね</span></p><p begin="0:37.310" en